defaultPosnSize ns
⍝ Implement defaults for properties Coord, Posn, Size

:If 0=ns.⎕NC 'Coord'
    ns.Coord←'Pixel' ⍝ /// This is wrong, of course
:EndIf

'Coord must be ''Pixel'' or ''ScaledPixel'' in Desktop mode (''Prop'' is Browser-only for now)' ⎕SIGNAL ((⊂⎕C ⍕ns.Coord)∊'pixel' 'scaledpixel')↓11
:If 0=⎕NC 'ns.Size'
    ns.Size←⌊devCaps.ScreenSize÷2
:EndIf

:If 0=⎕NC 'ns.Posn'
    ns.Posn←⌊(devCaps.ScreenSize-ns.Size)÷2
:EndIf
